    "comment": "Chilisso (4178-clh) = Threatened (40 percent certain, based on the evidence available) (Under great pressure by Shina. According to Hallberg, ‘A point which further underscores the idea that language shift is taking place in this community is the fact that of the thirteen individuals who were asked, four said that they spoke Chilisso in their home as a child but speak Shina in their home today’ (Hallberg in SSNP Vol. 1, 1992: 122-123).) [Rahman 2006](cldf:rahman:06)"
